{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L0xpZmUlMjBPbiUyMFRoZSUyMExpbmUlMjAlMjgyMDE1JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Life On The Line","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/uGGJJxcS1UA5hvZvQW0fOnn46tZ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/YIpBRJLhKa9doO3vjoUTndNlUB.jpg","description":"As a huge electrical storm sweeps towards Texas, lineman Beau Ginner is haunted by memories of his brother's death by lightning years earlier. Since that tragic day, he has raised his niece Bailey and risen to foreman of a lineman team. However, there is friction when Bailey's on-off boyfriend Duncan joins the crew, while another new recruit is hiding PTSD symptoms. Beau and his team are soon putting their lives at risk in a race to replace miles of power cables to keep the electrical grid running before the deadly lightning storm strikes. Based on a true story; this film is a tribute to the heroes who risk it all to keep us safe.","releaseInfo":"2015","genres":["Drama","Action","Thriller","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.8","runtime":"97 min","cast":["John Travolta","Kate Bosworth","Devon Sawa","Julie Benz","Ryan Robbins","Matt Bellefleur","Gil Bellows","Reese Alexander"],"director":["David Hackl"],"released":"2016-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"John Travolta","character":"Beau Ginner","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ap8eEYfBKTLixmVVpRlq4NslDD5.jpg"},{"name":"Kate Bosworth","character":"Bailey Ginner","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ezaM2jsyrxXWVFN1SbH3UfAgZaG.jpg"},{"name":"Devon Sawa","character":"Duncan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yvMbpZ0UFQ1IBwlWm8quCA6fNc5.jpg"},{"name":"Julie Benz","character":"Carline","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4rLq98jWRAOJIMzGZW0bB5Y6fGX.jpg"},{"name":"Ryan Robbins","character":"Eugene","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kZrq5a760JU1kHuxQ7Q8YCgsOr6.jpg"},{"name":"Matt Bellefleur","character":"Ron","photo":"https://image.tmd